graph TB
    User["Data Scientist<br/>(notebook / script)"]

    subgraph SDK["kubeflow-sdk (pip package: kubeflow 0.5.0) - client library, no deployed workload"]
        direction TB
        Trainer["kubeflow.trainer<br/>TrainerClient"]
        RHAI["kubeflow.trainer.rhai<br/>TransformersTrainer / TrainingHubTrainer /<br/>SpeculativeDecodingTrainer (midstream-only)"]
        Optimizer["kubeflow.optimizer<br/>OptimizerClient (Katib)"]
        Spark["kubeflow.spark<br/>SparkClient"]
        Hub["kubeflow.hub<br/>ModelRegistryClient"]
        Pipelines["kubeflow.pipelines<br/>PipelinesClient (re-export of kfp)"]
        Common["kubeflow.common<br/>backend config, namespace discovery, structlog"]

        subgraph Backends["Trainer backends"]
            K8sBackend["Kubernetes backend"]
            ContainerBackend["Container backend<br/>(Docker / Podman)"]
            LocalBackend["Local-process backend"]
        end

        RHAI -->|generates instrumented scripts| Trainer
        Trainer --> K8sBackend
        Trainer --> ContainerBackend
        Trainer --> LocalBackend
        Trainer --> Common
        Optimizer --> Common
        Spark --> Common
    end

    User -->|Python API| Trainer
    User -->|Python API| Optimizer
    User -->|Python API| Spark
    User -->|Python API| Hub
    User -->|Python API| Pipelines

    K8sAPI["Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS"]

    TrainJob["TrainJob CR<br/>trainer.kubeflow.org/v1alpha1"]
    Runtimes["ClusterTrainingRuntime / TrainingRuntime<br/>trainer.kubeflow.org/v1alpha1"]
    Experiment["Experiment / Trial CR<br/>kubeflow.org/v1beta1"]
    SparkConnect["SparkConnect CR<br/>sparkoperator.k8s.io/v1alpha1"]
    SparkApp["SparkApplication CR<br/>sparkoperator.k8s.io/v1beta2"]
    DataConn["Data Connection Secret<br/>(keys only -> secretKeyRef)"]

    K8sBackend -->|creates / watches / deletes| TrainJob
    K8sBackend -->|lists / reads| Runtimes
    RHAI -->|reads keys| DataConn
    Optimizer -->|creates / lists| Experiment
    Spark -->|creates| SparkConnect
    Spark -->|submits| SparkApp
    TrainJob -.->|via| K8sAPI
    Experiment -.->|via| K8sAPI
    SparkConnect -.->|via| K8sAPI

    TrainerCtl["Kubeflow Trainer controller"]
    Katib["Katib"]
    SparkOp["Spark Operator"]
    TrainJob -->|reconciled by| TrainerCtl
    Experiment -->|reconciled by| Katib
    SparkConnect -->|reconciled by| SparkOp
    SparkApp -->|reconciled by| SparkOp

    subgraph Pod["TrainJob pod (universal training image)"]
        Script["Generated training script<br/>(serialized user function + pip install)"]
        Metrics["Injected metrics HTTP server<br/>0.0.0.0:28080 (no auth)"]
        Reporter["Status reporter<br/>HTTPS POST + projected SA token"]
        VLLM["vllm-sidecar<br/>localhost:8234 (speculator only)"]
    end
    TrainerCtl -->|runs| Pod
    TrainerCtl -->|polls HTTP/28080| Metrics
    Reporter -->|HTTPS status| TrainerCtl

    SparkServer["Spark Connect server<br/>15002/TCP gRPC"]
    Spark -->|gRPC sc://| SparkServer
    MR["Model Registry REST"]
    KFP["Data Science Pipelines API"]
    S3["S3-compatible storage"]
    Hub -->|REST + Bearer| MR
    Hub -->|upload artifacts| S3
    Pipelines -->|REST + Bearer| KFP
    Script -->|checkpoints / outputs| S3

